abstract: >
  Proof-of-concept implementation and research artifact for Inductive Compliance,
  a noninvasive model for transition-centric policy gateing for declarative infrastructure.
  The project explores predecessor-aware authorization of guarded atomic
  transitions over projected policy-relevant system state, using NixOS as a
  practical prototype.
keywords:
  - NixOS
  - declarative infrastructure
  - compliance
  - fleet security
  - transition authorization
  - attestation
  - noninvasive security
  - policy enforcement
